| theDotNetWay | sidebar | 1 | 30.0 [30.0–30.0] | 2/2 | 1.01 |
| theDotNetWay | sidebar | 16 | 30.0 [30.0–30.0] | 2/2 | 1.00 |
| theDotNetWay | post_message | 1 | 30.0 [30.0–30.0] | 2/2 | 1.00 |
| theDotNetWay | post_message | 16 | 30.2 [30.2–30.2] | 2/2 | 1.01 |

